{"3090620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arcade Galaxy", "steam_appid": 3090620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 Welcome to Arcade Galaxy – Where Speed Meets Skill, and You’re the Architect of Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vibrant universe of chaos, creativity, and competition. In Arcade Galaxy, you don’t just play the game — you create it. Race, jump, climb, and crawl your way through an ever-expanding galaxy of user-generated levels, each one bursting with surprises and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as adorable, customizable animals called &quot;Cubs&quot;, and take on platforming courses that range from lightning-fast speedruns to mind-bending obstacle climbs. Whether you’re chasing world records or just trying not to fall off the map, every level is a new story! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/fccd61c525ce7046e5c8221cfabd39da.poster.avif?t=1785855594\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/fccd61c525ce7046e5c8221cfabd39da.webm?t=1785855594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/fccd61c525ce7046e5c8221cfabd39da.mp4?t=1785855594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛠️ Build. Break. Share.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use our intuitive level editor to build the platforming experience of your dreams. Create thrilling obstacles, clever traps, even mind boggling labyrinth for the world to challenge. Whether it’s crafting devilishly tricky jumps or designing the perfect run-through for others to 